### 1. Create User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@university.edu",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "fcmToken": "firebase_token_here"
}

###

### 2. Create Task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "course-uuid",
  "title": "Complete Math Homework",
  "description": "Solve problems 1-20 from chapter 5",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-25T23:59:00",
  "estimatedDuration": 120,
  "tags": ["homework", "mathematics"]
}

###

### 3. Update Task State
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "InProgress",
  "reason": "Started working on task"
}

###

### 4. Get Tasks by State
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/tasks/state/InProgress

###

### 5. Start Task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/start

###

### 6. Complete Task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete